  "fields": "language = NJDOE HomeLanguage (LANGUAGE_NAME in 2015-16), verbatim; pct = NJDOE %OfStudents (PCT_LANG in 2015-16), percent of the school's students.",
  "notes": "Labels are kept exactly as NJDOE published them each year, including \"Other\" (2015-16 to 2023-24) and \"Others\" (2024-25). NJDOE lists only the most common languages; the rest are counted in Other/Others. A language that does not appear for a school in a year was not listed by NJDOE that year (for example Spanish at St. Cloud in 2024-25); it is not a zero. The 2015-16 LanguageDiversity table used different rules and lists some languages under 1%. Rows are ordered English first, then by share, with Other/Others last. West Orange district code 13-5680; schools 300 and 301 (early childhood centers) are omitted because the tool covers 11 schools."
 },
